{"id":"twitter:1919720220593139804","tweet_id":"1919720220593139804","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1919720220593139804","title":"@PaulP1534504 @LeaderJohnThune @SpeakerJohnson @GOP Besides adding tariffs to the Penguins? Do you know what a 145% tariff on Chinese imports does? It","summary":"@PaulP1534504 @LeaderJohnThune @SpeakerJohnson @GOP Besides adding tariffs to the Penguins? Do you know what a 145% tariff on Chinese imports does? It destroys American small businesses and will launch a recession while allowing China to develop alternative markets. It's a Centralized Command Economy, bad for the country https://t.co/6V1wc7CqcA","date":"2025-05-06","published":"2025-05-06T11:45:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PaulP1534504/status/1919718518888497551","reply_tweet_id":"1919718518888497551","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PaulP1534504 @LeaderJohnThune @SpeakerJohnson @GOP Besides adding tariffs to the Penguins?<br><br>Do you know what a 145% tariff on Chinese imports does?<br><br>It destroys American small businesses and will launch a recession while allowing China to develop alternative markets.<br><br>It&#x27;s a Centralized Command Economy, bad for the country <a href=\"https://t.co/6V1wc7CqcA\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6V1wc7CqcA</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d76aa2ec1ecaadda793925ddba9e199e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1919720220593139804","display_date":"May 06, 2025 · 11:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d76aa2ec1ecaadda793925ddba9e199e.jpg"]}
