{"id":"twitter:1919541748713308375","tweet_id":"1919541748713308375","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1919541748713308375","title":"You can extend the middle class tax cuts and let the Billionaire tax cuts expire. Just like you can increase the FICA ceiling and not change Social Se","summary":"You can extend the middle class tax cuts and let the Billionaire tax cuts expire. Just like you can increase the FICA ceiling and not change Social Security benefits. Stop pretending it is all or nothing. Americans don't care about Koch Industries https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1919500414900215842","date":"2025-05-05","published":"2025-05-05T23:56:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can extend the middle class tax cuts and let the Billionaire tax cuts expire.<br><br>Just like you can increase the FICA ceiling and not change Social Security benefits.<br><br>Stop pretending it is all or nothing.<br><br>Americans don&#x27;t care about Koch Industries <a href=\"https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1919500414900215842\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1919500414900215842</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1919541748713308375","display_date":"May 05, 2025 · 23:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
