{"id":"twitter:2091748582319681793","tweet_id":"2091748582319681793","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2091748582319681793","title":"A password book is a very secure tool for most families. If someone has access to your password book, the issues with physical security are of a much ","summary":"A password book is a very secure tool for most families. If someone has access to your password book, the issues with physical security are of a much bigger concern. I am not teaching my grandma to use a password app and a yubikey. https://x.com/erikstmartin/status/2091617742335918094","date":"2026-08-24","published":"2026-08-24T04:44:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A password book is a very secure tool for most families.<br><br>If someone has access to your password book, the issues with physical security are of a much bigger concern.<br><br>I am not teaching my grandma to use a password app and a yubikey. <a href=\"https://x.com/erikstmartin/status/2091617742335918094\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/erikstmartin/status/2091617742335918094</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2091748582319681793","display_date":"August 24, 2026 · 04:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
