{"id":"twitter:2052197712838160656","tweet_id":"2052197712838160656","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2052197712838160656","title":"@Cydsinc I keep extras around, next batch I mailed I wrapped. You should get your Khartiia soon. The non-machinable mail takes longer... And people do","summary":"@Cydsinc I keep extras around, next batch I mailed I wrapped. You should get your Khartiia soon. The non-machinable mail takes longer... And people don't always follow the non-machinable rules. I guess. And I just think US First Class is just less reliable since Dejoy","date":"2026-05-07","published":"2026-05-07T01:23:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Cydsinc/status/2052196641650737530","reply_tweet_id":"2052196641650737530","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Cydsinc I keep extras around, next batch I mailed I wrapped.<br><br>You should get your Khartiia soon.<br><br>The non-machinable mail takes longer... And people don&#x27;t always follow the non-machinable rules. I guess.<br><br>And I just think US First Class is just less reliable since Dejoy</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2052197712838160656","display_date":"May 07, 2026 · 01:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2052196804221882848","tweet_id":"2052196804221882848","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2052196804221882848","title":"Singer and the Prince seek recompense in nonsense of Sattelite thresholds and untruths retold. A discernible distance in noise sung on pistons and pla","summary":"Singer and the Prince seek recompense in nonsense of Sattelite thresholds and untruths retold. A discernible distance in noise sung on pistons and plastic Institutions who rise with no foundation but Street lies in heated skies. #smallpoems","date":"2026-05-07","published":"2026-05-07T01:20:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Singer and the Prince<br>seek recompense<br>in nonsense of<br>Sattelite thresholds<br>and untruths<br>retold.<br>A discernible distance<br>in noise sung on<br> pistons and plastic<br>Institutions who rise<br>with no<br>foundation<br>but Street lies<br>in heated skies.<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2052196804221882848","display_date":"May 07, 2026 · 01:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
