{"id":"twitter:1917183920019214545","tweet_id":"1917183920019214545","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1917183920019214545","title":"Enjoy the long ride Bob Metzger hard to imagine world of Defense and cybersecurity and supply chain risk management without Bob. Met Bob when he would","summary":"Enjoy the long ride Bob Metzger hard to imagine world of Defense and cybersecurity and supply chain risk management without Bob. Met Bob when he would always volunteer to be on our CMMC panels for manufacturers here in Connecticut His insights could shift a nation Miss you https://t.co/pRFliT74ye","date":"2025-04-29","published":"2025-04-29T11:47:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Enjoy the long ride Bob Metzger<br><br>hard to imagine world of Defense and cybersecurity and supply chain risk management without Bob.<br><br>Met Bob  when he would always volunteer to be on our CMMC panels for manufacturers here in Connecticut<br><br>His insights could shift a nation<br><br>Miss you <a href=\"https://t.co/pRFliT74ye\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/pRFliT74ye</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c8dcab80508389b23437c17361401d7b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1917183920019214545","display_date":"April 29, 2025 · 11:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c8dcab80508389b23437c17361401d7b.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1917182849293185488","tweet_id":"1917182849293185488","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1917182849293185488","title":"Folks just remember CMMC is an assessment tool. It is not a Cybersecurity Framework. It is not a standard. It is a third party check to see if your (c","summary":"Folks just remember CMMC is an assessment tool. It is not a Cybersecurity Framework. It is not a standard. It is a third party check to see if your (chosen) cybersecurity framework meets the NIST-SP-800-171 standard laid out in requirements of DFARS 252.204-7012 But… https://t.co/fJ2nNTumoF","date":"2025-04-29","published":"2025-04-29T11:43:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Folks just remember CMMC is an assessment tool. <br><br>It  is not a Cybersecurity Framework. It is not a standard. It is a third  party check to see if your (chosen) cybersecurity framework meets the  NIST-SP-800-171 standard laid out in requirements of DFARS 252.204-7012<br><br>But… <a href=\"https://t.co/fJ2nNTumoF\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/fJ2nNTumoF</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0cd110f6e9eae3392031686cb0606837.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1917182849293185488","display_date":"April 29, 2025 · 11:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0cd110f6e9eae3392031686cb0606837.jpg"]}
