{"id":"twitter:1917176615991173239","tweet_id":"1917176615991173239","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1917176615991173239","title":"Since 1963 CDLs have had English language requirement as part of the Federal Motor Carrier Safety Regulations. The law mandates that commercial driver","summary":"Since 1963 CDLs have had English language requirement as part of the Federal Motor Carrier Safety Regulations. The law mandates that commercial drivers in interstate commerce be able to \"read and speak the English language. This is just more Kabuke Theater from @WhiteHouse https://x.com/FoxNews/status/1917002682474057882","date":"2025-04-29","published":"2025-04-29T11:18:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Since 1963 CDLs have had  English language requirement as part of the Federal Motor Carrier Safety Regulations.<br><br>The law  mandates that commercial drivers in interstate commerce be able to &quot;read and speak the English language.<br><br>This is just more Kabuke Theater from @WhiteHouse <a href=\"https://x.com/FoxNews/status/1917002682474057882\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/FoxNews/status/1917002682474057882</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1917176615991173239","display_date":"April 29, 2025 · 11:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
