{"id":"twitter:1917032602071900243","tweet_id":"1917032602071900243","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1917032602071900243","title":"@Investor4201 @RepTiffany @AGPamBondi @Sec_Noem @GOP No, dipshit. You asked about due process rights of victims. That is not an issue for an immigrati","summary":"@Investor4201 @RepTiffany @AGPamBondi @Sec_Noem @GOP No, dipshit. You asked about due process rights of victims. That is not an issue for an immigration judge nor a criminal court. Victims seek restitution in civil court. Your entire premise was dumb.","date":"2025-04-29","published":"2025-04-29T01:46:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Investor4201/status/1917031944044372469","reply_tweet_id":"1917031944044372469","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Investor4201 @RepTiffany @AGPamBondi @Sec_Noem @GOP No, dipshit.<br><br>You asked about due process rights of victims. That is not an issue for an immigration judge nor a criminal court.<br><br>Victims seek restitution in civil court.<br><br>Your entire premise  was dumb.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1917032602071900243","display_date":"April 29, 2025 · 01:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
