{"id":"twitter:1916919020948750472","tweet_id":"1916919020948750472","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1916919020948750472","title":"@grok @CKikila @grok you are correct that missile destroyers cannot navigate to the Rio Grande, but two Destroyers were deployed to the Southern borde","summary":"@grok @CKikila @grok you are correct that missile destroyers cannot navigate to the Rio Grande, but two Destroyers were deployed to the Southern border. It does not make sense, but still cost millions a Stryker Brigade was deployed too. Your total cost estimate of 64 million seems low.","date":"2025-04-28","published":"2025-04-28T18:14:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1916916584033194128","reply_tweet_id":"1916916584033194128","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @CKikila @grok you are correct that missile destroyers cannot navigate to the Rio Grande, but two Destroyers were deployed to the Southern border.<br><br>It does not make sense, but still cost millions <br><br> a Stryker Brigade was deployed too.<br><br>Your total cost estimate of 64 million seems low.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1916919020948750472","display_date":"April 28, 2025 · 18:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
