{"id":"twitter:1916879072715592110","tweet_id":"1916879072715592110","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1916879072715592110","title":"@Lorelei_0502 The first russian spy \"Black Widow\" did not have red hair \"Natasha\" Alianovna Romanova did grow up in the \"red Room\" born 1928, rumored ","summary":"@Lorelei_0502 The first russian spy \"Black Widow\" did not have red hair \"Natasha\" Alianovna Romanova did grow up in the \"red Room\" born 1928, rumored royalty, raised by a Russian soldier Ivan Petrovich Bezukhov after Stalingrad left her in orphan. she joined \"Red Room\" to save Bezukhov https://t.co/iwlkAWfwLn","date":"2025-04-28","published":"2025-04-28T15:35:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lorelei_0502/status/1916877847341273290","reply_tweet_id":"1916877847341273290","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lorelei_0502 The first russian spy &quot;Black Widow&quot; did not have red hair<br><br>&quot;Natasha&quot; Alianovna Romanova did grow up in the &quot;red Room&quot;<br><br>born  1928, rumored  royalty, raised by a Russian soldier Ivan Petrovich Bezukhov after  Stalingrad left her in orphan.  she joined  &quot;Red Room&quot; to save Bezukhov <a href=\"https://t.co/iwlkAWfwLn\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/iwlkAWfwLn</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1d5d7f8e2e03cbd219ec6206970e53e2.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1916879072715592110","display_date":"April 28, 2025 · 15:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1d5d7f8e2e03cbd219ec6206970e53e2.png"]}
