{"id":"twitter:2052052398181343307","tweet_id":"2052052398181343307","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2052052398181343307","title":"First make sure you use 2FA. If your account is compromised consider it could be your other credentials, like email, that allowed access. The non-nati","summary":"First make sure you use 2FA. If your account is compromised consider it could be your other credentials, like email, that allowed access. The non-native tools, if you are not Premium, are more secure than X's 2FA. If you need help turning it on, just ask Then blow it up. https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2052006811209728282","date":"2026-05-06","published":"2026-05-06T15:46:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>First make sure you use 2FA.<br><br> If your account is compromised consider it could be your other credentials, like  email, that allowed access.<br><br>The non-native tools, if you are not Premium, are more secure than X&#x27;s 2FA.<br><br>If you need help turning it on, just ask<br><br>Then blow it up. <a href=\"https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2052006811209728282\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/theliamnissan/status/2052006811209728282</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2052052398181343307","display_date":"May 06, 2026 · 15:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
