{"id":"twitter:1915593060651590082","tweet_id":"1915593060651590082","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915593060651590082","title":"Did you know in the Constitution the Legislative Branch and the States run elections? The Executive has no role in elections. You can literally read t","summary":"Did you know in the Constitution the Legislative Branch and the States run elections? The Executive has no role in elections. You can literally read the Constitution and learn this. Read it 2-3 times, maybe remember it. https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1915504490444214589","date":"2025-04-25","published":"2025-04-25T02:25:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Did you know in the Constitution the Legislative Branch and the States run elections?<br><br>The Executive has no role in elections.<br><br>You can literally read the Constitution and learn this.<br><br>Read it 2-3 times, maybe remember it. <a href=\"https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1915504490444214589\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/MarshaBlackburn/status/1915504490444214589</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915593060651590082","display_date":"April 25, 2025 · 02:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
