{"id":"twitter:1915051653432054047","tweet_id":"1915051653432054047","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915051653432054047","title":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 Do you like a poem about Tanya where bliss and a bit of nirvana is found when the last word rhymes with what you just heard That ","summary":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 Do you like a poem about Tanya where bliss and a bit of nirvana is found when the last word rhymes with what you just heard That is called a rhyme scheme this one a strict AABB regime A rhyme pattern controls flow tells the reader where you will go I tend to bend poems I send…","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T14:34:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ratty886/status/1915049833653829947","reply_tweet_id":"1915049833653829947","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 Do  you like a poem about Tanya<br>where bliss and a bit of nirvana<br>is found when the last word<br>rhymes with what you just heard<br><br>That is called a rhyme scheme<br>this one a strict AABB regime<br>A rhyme pattern controls flow<br>tells the reader where you will go<br><br>I tend to bend poems <br>I send…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915051653432054047","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 14:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1915049938695962820","tweet_id":"1915049938695962820","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915049938695962820","title":"You can want recruitment thresholds to be met, and not have National Defense Secrets leaked from unmanaged devices Those are two different things I am","summary":"You can want recruitment thresholds to be met, and not have National Defense Secrets leaked from unmanaged devices Those are two different things I am surprised @VP can't see the difference https://x.com/DOWResponse/status/1915032921146093735","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T14:27:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can want recruitment thresholds to be met, and not have National Defense Secrets leaked from unmanaged devices <br><br>Those are two different things<br><br>I am surprised @VP can&#x27;t see the difference <a href=\"https://x.com/DOWResponse/status/1915032921146093735\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/DOWResponse/status/1915032921146093735</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915049938695962820","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 14:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
