{"id":"twitter:1915049222392742161","tweet_id":"1915049222392742161","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915049222392742161","title":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 want something different or prefer poetry with traditional rhyme scheme I can try again after work style is more free form and s ","summary":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 want something different or prefer poetry with traditional rhyme scheme I can try again after work style is more free form and s with unbalanced stanza versus something with one thought idea per stanza request a sestina, and that I probably can't do off the cuff","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T14:24:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ratty886/status/1915031546798448685","reply_tweet_id":"1915031546798448685","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 want something different or prefer poetry with traditional rhyme scheme I can try again after work<br><br>style is more free form and s with unbalanced stanza versus something with  one thought idea per stanza<br><br>request a sestina, and that I probably can&#x27;t do off the cuff</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915049222392742161","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 14:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
