{"id":"twitter:1915046670628257866","tweet_id":"1915046670628257866","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915046670628257866","title":"A poem from @ratty886 to @tanyawoz1 Answer Siren's Call as Soundsystems awaken a sullen soul Jahlovemusik must meet fire proof freedoms among tattered","summary":"A poem from @ratty886 to @tanyawoz1 Answer Siren's Call as Soundsystems awaken a sullen soul Jahlovemusik must meet fire proof freedoms among tattered brick factories, haunted memories lost in walls A wail of Lady of Theotokos sings to Twelve Tribes of Israels who dine on… https://x.com/ratty886/status/1915036404817478141 https://t.co/07MZ8x9feQ","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T14:14:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A poem from @ratty886 to @tanyawoz1 <br><br>Answer Siren&#x27;s Call<br>as Soundsystems  awaken<br>a sullen soul<br>Jahlovemusik must meet<br>fire proof freedoms<br>among tattered brick factories,<br>haunted memories lost in walls<br>A wail of Lady of Theotokos sings to<br>Twelve Tribes of Israels who<br> dine on… <a href=\"https://x.com/ratty886/status/1915036404817478141\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/ratty886/status/1915036404817478141</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/07MZ8x9feQ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/07MZ8x9feQ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e79b4376859ab60ee2b22ee63c1770f5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915046670628257866","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 14:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e79b4376859ab60ee2b22ee63c1770f5.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1915039942167953813","tweet_id":"1915039942167953813","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915039942167953813","title":"@tanyawoz1 I always run out of cash, but rarely out words Should improve my economic thinking around each but until then maybe we can rustle up the si","summary":"@tanyawoz1 I always run out of cash, but rarely out words Should improve my economic thinking around each but until then maybe we can rustle up the sickly freedom lulled to sleep for words are also deeds https://t.co/FWJlukRdTG","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T13:47:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tanyawoz1/status/1915030433584103761","reply_tweet_id":"1915030433584103761","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tanyawoz1 I always run out of cash, but rarely  out words<br><br>Should improve my economic thinking around each<br><br>but until then<br><br>maybe we can rustle up the sickly freedom lulled to sleep for words are also deeds <a href=\"https://t.co/FWJlukRdTG\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/FWJlukRdTG</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/03403fb1e02848244809f889d17c5397.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915039942167953813","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 13:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/03403fb1e02848244809f889d17c5397.png"]}
