{"id":"twitter:1915036211829162386","tweet_id":"1915036211829162386","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1915036211829162386","title":"\"Don't envy, friend, a wealthy man: A rich man's life is spent Without a friend or faithful love — Those things he has to rent.\" https://x.com/dogeoff","summary":"\"Don't envy, friend, a wealthy man: A rich man's life is spent Without a friend or faithful love — Those things he has to rent.\" https://x.com/dogeofficialceo/status/1914741136008339670","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T13:33:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>&quot;Don&#x27;t envy, friend, a wealthy man:<br>A rich man&#x27;s life is spent<br>Without a friend or faithful love —<br>Those things he has to rent.&quot; <a href=\"https://x.com/dogeofficialceo/status/1914741136008339670\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/dogeofficialceo/status/1914741136008339670</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1915036211829162386","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 13:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
