{"id":"twitter:1914870045722730645","tweet_id":"1914870045722730645","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1914870045722730645","title":"@sandibachom And the laws for Classified access are different, but again President can grant anyone access. Most of the systems DOGE touch would have ","summary":"@sandibachom And the laws for Classified access are different, but again President can grant anyone access. Most of the systems DOGE touch would have data protection requirements well before anything Classified.","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T02:32:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1914862117930336262","reply_tweet_id":"1914862117930336262","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@sandibachom And the laws for Classified access are different, but again President can grant anyone access.<br><br>Most of the systems DOGE touch would have data protection requirements well before anything Classified.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1914870045722730645","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 02:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1914864587347800202","tweet_id":"1914864587347800202","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1914864587347800202","title":"@ingramlaw You can play with the data of you wish. I haven't seen the State data that all medicaid expansion recipients don't work KFF does use the CB","summary":"@ingramlaw You can play with the data of you wish. I haven't seen the State data that all medicaid expansion recipients don't work KFF does use the CBO report as well, and while self-report data may be imperfect, I don't ignore it. https://www.cbo.gov/publication/57702","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T02:11:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ingramlaw/status/1914862497116442996","reply_tweet_id":"1914862497116442996","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ingramlaw You can play with the data of you wish.<br><br>I haven&#x27;t seen the State data that all medicaid expansion recipients don&#x27;t work<br><br>KFF does use the CBO report as well, and while self-report data may be imperfect, I don&#x27;t ignore it. <br><br><a href=\"https://www.cbo.gov/publication/57702\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.cbo.gov/publication/57702</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1914864587347800202","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 02:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1914862531014807710","tweet_id":"1914862531014807710","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1914862531014807710","title":"@SA_Gunnison @sandibachom The Executive is pretty much in the clear with the ability to grant anyone authorized access. They key are the other laws, r","summary":"@SA_Gunnison @sandibachom The Executive is pretty much in the clear with the ability to grant anyone authorized access. They key are the other laws, regulations, and Government policies protecting the Confidentially and Integrity of the Assets in question.","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T02:02:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SA_Gunnison/status/1914858021630480646","reply_tweet_id":"1914858021630480646","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SA_Gunnison @sandibachom The Executive is pretty much in the clear with the ability to grant anyone authorized access.<br><br>They key are the other laws, regulations, and Government policies protecting the Confidentially and Integrity of the Assets in question.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1914862531014807710","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 02:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1914862117930336262","tweet_id":"1914862117930336262","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1914862117930336262","title":"@sandibachom The way Federal Laws are written the Secretary, Commerce Secretary, or President can grant authorized access. You need to go FISMA>FIPS 2","summary":"@sandibachom The way Federal Laws are written the Secretary, Commerce Secretary, or President can grant authorized access. You need to go FISMA>FIPS 2199/200>OMB-130>Each Department's RMF plan. But other laws protect the data beyond who is the authorizing agent.","date":"2025-04-23","published":"2025-04-23T02:01:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/sandibachom/status/1914855220892311913","reply_tweet_id":"1914855220892311913","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@sandibachom The way Federal Laws are written the Secretary, Commerce Secretary, or President can grant authorized access.<br><br>You need to go FISMA&gt;FIPS 2199/200&gt;OMB-130&gt;Each Department&#x27;s RMF plan.<br><br>But other laws protect the data beyond who is the authorizing agent.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1914862117930336262","display_date":"April 23, 2025 · 02:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
