{"id":"twitter:1913750485720301820","tweet_id":"1913750485720301820","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913750485720301820","title":"@GOP Common thread going throughfar-right media has been media bias The first generation of \"new right\" authors were IVY league schoolers. But the eme","summary":"@GOP Common thread going throughfar-right media has been media bias The first generation of \"new right\" authors were IVY league schoolers. But the emergence of paperbacks brought in the era or self publishing and a ton more crazy Like Vance Packards, 1957 \"The Hidden Persuaders\" https://t.co/TDBbRnub50","date":"2025-04-20","published":"2025-04-20T00:24:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913749551686484292","reply_tweet_id":"1913749551686484292","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GOP Common thread going throughfar-right media has been media bias<br><br>The first generation of &quot;new right&quot; authors were IVY league schoolers.<br><br>But the emergence of paperbacks brought in the era or self publishing and a ton more crazy<br><br>Like Vance Packards, 1957 &quot;The Hidden Persuaders&quot; <a href=\"https://t.co/TDBbRnub50\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/TDBbRnub50</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ae17147122f2f4b4920e394656de6685.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913750485720301820","display_date":"April 20, 2025 · 00:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ae17147122f2f4b4920e394656de6685.jpg"]}
