{"id":"twitter:1913748632966467832","tweet_id":"1913748632966467832","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913748632966467832","title":"@GOP The next major Bible of Conservative thought was Russel Kirk's Conservative Mind in 1953. The books being published by the new Regnrey Publishing","summary":"@GOP The next major Bible of Conservative thought was Russel Kirk's Conservative Mind in 1953. The books being published by the new Regnrey Publishing, Devin-Adair, and Caxton Publishing pushed Libertarian and Conservative ideas. Regnrey would turn it into a mission https://t.co/Nbafgo4sBO","date":"2025-04-20","published":"2025-04-20T00:16:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913747500659339323","reply_tweet_id":"1913747500659339323","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GOP The next major Bible of Conservative thought was  Russel Kirk&#x27;s Conservative Mind in 1953.<br><br>The books being published by the new Regnrey Publishing, Devin-Adair, and Caxton Publishing pushed Libertarian and Conservative ideas. <br><br>Regnrey would turn it into a mission <a href=\"https://t.co/Nbafgo4sBO\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Nbafgo4sBO</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f88e2eb234f0400471bee3fde3735259.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913748632966467832","display_date":"April 20, 2025 · 00:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f88e2eb234f0400471bee3fde3735259.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1913747500659339323","tweet_id":"1913747500659339323","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913747500659339323","title":"@GOP It would be William Buckley's \"Of God and Men at Yale\" that would put Conservative Media on the map (Hearst Excluded) in 1951 The @GOP attacks on","summary":"@GOP It would be William Buckley's \"Of God and Men at Yale\" that would put Conservative Media on the map (Hearst Excluded) in 1951 The @GOP attacks on Harvard aren't new. Buckley had them beat in 1951 https://t.co/jlqtYngf9x","date":"2025-04-20","published":"2025-04-20T00:12:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913747113768345808","reply_tweet_id":"1913747113768345808","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GOP It would be William Buckley&#x27;s &quot;Of God and Men at Yale&quot; that would put Conservative Media on the map (Hearst Excluded) in 1951<br><br>The @GOP attacks on Harvard aren&#x27;t new. Buckley had them beat in 1951 <a href=\"https://t.co/jlqtYngf9x\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/jlqtYngf9x</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f274ea5f989dc519bf48cec3501fb8aa.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913747500659339323","display_date":"April 20, 2025 · 00:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f274ea5f989dc519bf48cec3501fb8aa.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1913747113768345808","tweet_id":"1913747113768345808","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913747113768345808","title":"@GOP Then you have the Dixiecrat Bible \"Wither Solid South,\" published by Charles Wallace Collins in 1947 This would unite the same arguments agaiunst","summary":"@GOP Then you have the Dixiecrat Bible \"Wither Solid South,\" published by Charles Wallace Collins in 1947 This would unite the same arguments agaiunst the Fed and Income with anti-communism and pro-segregationist movements https://t.co/POXZCZcIDm","date":"2025-04-20","published":"2025-04-20T00:10:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913745947563041181","reply_tweet_id":"1913745947563041181","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GOP Then you have the Dixiecrat Bible &quot;Wither Solid South,&quot; published by Charles Wallace Collins in 1947<br><br>This would unite the same arguments agaiunst the Fed and Income with anti-communism and pro-segregationist movements <a href=\"https://t.co/POXZCZcIDm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/POXZCZcIDm</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f97d00cb917e2a52a70706ea0b145cff.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913747113768345808","display_date":"April 20, 2025 · 00:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f97d00cb917e2a52a70706ea0b145cff.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1913745947563041181","tweet_id":"1913745947563041181","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913745947563041181","title":"@GOP Then you have Hayek's 1944 book , \"the Road to Serfdom\" Hayek popularized terms \"statist,\" \"collectivist,\" and \"individualist.\" frame \"private pr","summary":"@GOP Then you have Hayek's 1944 book , \"the Road to Serfdom\" Hayek popularized terms \"statist,\" \"collectivist,\" and \"individualist.\" frame \"private property\" and \"low taxes\" as anti-communist. Language used today. Never approach a Libertarian who is drinking and read Hayek https://t.co/kopfcUiY3q","date":"2025-04-20","published":"2025-04-20T00:06:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913745215455895698","reply_tweet_id":"1913745215455895698","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GOP Then you have Hayek&#x27;s 1944  book , &quot;the Road to Serfdom&quot;<br><br>Hayek popularized terms &quot;statist,&quot; &quot;collectivist,&quot; and &quot;individualist.&quot;<br><br> frame &quot;private property&quot; and &quot;low taxes&quot; as anti-communist.<br><br>Language used today.<br><br>Never approach a Libertarian who is drinking and read Hayek <a href=\"https://t.co/kopfcUiY3q\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/kopfcUiY3q</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/269952c121d41f6ba1a5176365c804d3.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913745947563041181","display_date":"April 20, 2025 · 00:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/269952c121d41f6ba1a5176365c804d3.jpg"]}
