{"id":"twitter:1913743933412114856","tweet_id":"1913743933412114856","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1913743933412114856","title":"But because the @GOP is built more upon the ideals of ideological purity, more ink gets spilled in the direction of the right These stories range from","summary":"But because the @GOP is built more upon the ideals of ideological purity, more ink gets spilled in the direction of the right These stories range from economic scholars to to the total crazy and everything in between. But it is an Asymmetric phenomenon, often of liars https://t.co/ed1osivFri","date":"2025-04-19","published":"2025-04-19T23:58:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913739204888002603","reply_tweet_id":"1913739204888002603","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>But because the @GOP is built more upon the ideals of ideological purity, more ink gets spilled in the direction of the right<br><br>These stories range from economic scholars to to the total crazy and everything in between.<br><br>But it is an Asymmetric phenomenon, often of liars <a href=\"https://t.co/ed1osivFri\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ed1osivFri</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bdcdadc44019bcad5dde5fc757b367d2.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1913743933412114856","display_date":"April 19, 2025 · 23:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bdcdadc44019bcad5dde5fc757b367d2.jpg"]}
