{"id":"twitter:1912993349360824627","tweet_id":"1912993349360824627","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912993349360824627","title":"Again, If these folks were deported to El Salvador under authority in the Aliens Enemy Act. Wouldn't that mean @GOP is posing with prisoners of war? A","summary":"Again, If these folks were deported to El Salvador under authority in the Aliens Enemy Act. Wouldn't that mean @GOP is posing with prisoners of war? And if that is true wouldn't the photos violate the Geneva Convention about using prisoners of war as Propaganda? https://x.com/Mollyploofkins/status/1912987203283599390","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T22:15:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Again,<br><br>If these folks were deported to El Salvador under authority in the Aliens Enemy Act.<br><br>Wouldn&#x27;t that mean @GOP is posing with prisoners of war?<br><br>And if that is true wouldn&#x27;t the photos violate the Geneva Convention about using prisoners of war as Propaganda? <a href=\"https://x.com/Mollyploofkins/status/1912987203283599390\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Mollyploofkins/status/1912987203283599390</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912993349360824627","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 22:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
