{"id":"twitter:1912992843007971575","tweet_id":"1912992843007971575","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912992843007971575","title":"Please document these false positives. It feels like @Safety is distorting the narrative by borking content mod Tools. https://x.com/BabeTruth2/status","summary":"Please document these false positives. It feels like @Safety is distorting the narrative by borking content mod Tools. https://x.com/BabeTruth2/status/1912922637170335867","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T22:13:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Please document these false positives.<br><br>It feels like @Safety is distorting the narrative by borking content mod Tools. <a href=\"https://x.com/BabeTruth2/status/1912922637170335867\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/BabeTruth2/status/1912922637170335867</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912992843007971575","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 22:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1912992349082337447","tweet_id":"1912992349082337447","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912992349082337447","title":"@Mollyploofkins No. The data was encrypted before it was sent over TLS which is also encrypted. It would be impossible to edit those packets,and if it","summary":"@Mollyploofkins No. The data was encrypted before it was sent over TLS which is also encrypted. It would be impossible to edit those packets,and if it was done @CISAgov would have seen it. The minds were hacked, not the machines. It's a wet ware problem.","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T22:11:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Mollyploofkins/status/1912991035866653174","reply_tweet_id":"1912991035866653174","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Mollyploofkins No.<br><br>The data was encrypted before it was sent over TLS which is also encrypted.<br><br>It would be impossible to edit those packets,and if it was done @CISAgov would have seen it.<br><br>The minds were hacked, not the machines.<br><br>It&#x27;s a wet ware problem.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912992349082337447","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 22:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1912991530597617956","tweet_id":"1912991530597617956","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912991530597617956","title":"They were investigated, charged and denied bail. Then many were tried and sentenced. We call that due process. https://t.co/aIH3hauOWq","summary":"They were investigated, charged and denied bail. Then many were tried and sentenced. We call that due process. https://t.co/aIH3hauOWq","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T22:08:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>They were investigated, charged and denied bail.<br><br>Then many were tried and sentenced. <br><br>We call that due process. <a href=\"https://t.co/aIH3hauOWq\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aIH3hauOWq</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c9dd2d82e9fd6c2a974b3469cc7fcd6b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912991530597617956","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 22:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c9dd2d82e9fd6c2a974b3469cc7fcd6b.jpg"]}
