{"id":"twitter:1912850074687721916","tweet_id":"1912850074687721916","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912850074687721916","title":"A NAFO gift poem for @GoneSailingNow Head and weather helm in trust complete confide our miseries to the wind and tack victories to broad reach of his","summary":"A NAFO gift poem for @GoneSailingNow Head and weather helm in trust complete confide our miseries to the wind and tack victories to broad reach of histories setting sails to luff Trust floats on mistrust a closed haul, pulled tight in the inferiority of industry… https://x.com/GoneSailingNow/status/1912841104589742332 https://t.co/PDyoASByjm","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T12:46:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A NAFO gift poem for @GoneSailingNow <br><br>Head and weather helm<br>in trust complete<br>    confide our miseries to the<br>wind and  tack victories to<br>broad reach of histories<br>  setting sails to luff<br>Trust floats on mistrust<br>  a closed haul, pulled tight<br>in the inferiority of industry… <a href=\"https://x.com/GoneSailingNow/status/1912841104589742332\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/GoneSailingNow/status/1912841104589742332</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/PDyoASByjm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/PDyoASByjm</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4c6c07382380db303a6880bcf630859e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912850074687721916","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 12:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4c6c07382380db303a6880bcf630859e.jpg"]}
