{"id":"twitter:1912686542750949458","tweet_id":"1912686542750949458","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912686542750949458","title":"The U stands for Unclassified.. So what was declassified? Does ODNI mean they decontrolled the data? The document is written as if controlled and clas","summary":"The U stands for Unclassified.. So what was declassified? Does ODNI mean they decontrolled the data? The document is written as if controlled and classified data were co-mingled but I don't see anything that was Classified. Am I reading it incorrectly? https://x.com/DaisyBelleLace/status/1912653305689395419","date":"2025-04-17","published":"2025-04-17T01:56:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The U stands for Unclassified.. So what was declassified?<br><br>Does ODNI mean they decontrolled the data?<br><br>The document is written as if controlled and classified data were co-mingled but I don&#x27;t see anything that was Classified.<br><br>Am I reading it incorrectly? <a href=\"https://x.com/DaisyBelleLace/status/1912653305689395419\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/DaisyBelleLace/status/1912653305689395419</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912686542750949458","display_date":"April 17, 2025 · 01:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
