{"id":"twitter:1912646807869587720","tweet_id":"1912646807869587720","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912646807869587720","title":"@elisabethinwa @Nessakins_ Ha ha, funny story. I went to the movies with my kids, their cousin, and their uncle to see Sonic III Matt might have calle","summary":"@elisabethinwa @Nessakins_ Ha ha, funny story. I went to the movies with my kids, their cousin, and their uncle to see Sonic III Matt might have called my son a \"goon\" in the bathroom without knowing the context. Literally every kid and Dad in the bathroom dragged him He then went home and Googled it.","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T23:18:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/elisabethinwa/status/1912631612325654883","reply_tweet_id":"1912631612325654883","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@elisabethinwa @Nessakins_ Ha ha, funny story. I went to the movies with my kids, their cousin, and their uncle to see Sonic III<br><br>Matt might have called my son a &quot;goon&quot; in the bathroom without knowing the context.<br><br>Literally every kid and Dad in the bathroom dragged him<br><br>He then went home and Googled it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912646807869587720","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 23:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1912645334590796176","tweet_id":"1912645334590796176","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912645334590796176","title":"@CharlotteInMe @alaynatreene It's true The IRS did revoke Bob Jones University status in 1978 and Supreme Court ruled in 1983 Under 26 U.S. Code § 721","summary":"@CharlotteInMe @alaynatreene It's true The IRS did revoke Bob Jones University status in 1978 and Supreme Court ruled in 1983 Under 26 U.S. Code § 7217 the President and vice President ARE EXPLICITLY forbidden to influence audits and tax exempt status So that could be used by Harvard in court","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T23:12:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CharlotteInMe/status/1912634399004188965","reply_tweet_id":"1912634399004188965","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CharlotteInMe @alaynatreene It&#x27;s true<br><br>The IRS did revoke Bob Jones University status in 1978 and Supreme Court ruled in 1983<br><br>Under 26 U.S. Code § 7217 the President and vice President ARE EXPLICITLY forbidden to influence audits and tax exempt status<br><br>So that could be used by Harvard in court</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912645334590796176","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 23:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
