{"id":"twitter:1912542035103412526","tweet_id":"1912542035103412526","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912542035103412526","title":"@SenBillCassidy Bad at math? Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect If people put money into a Piggy Bank, and th","summary":"@SenBillCassidy Bad at math? Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect If people put money into a Piggy Bank, and those same people rarely take money out. Would making it so those people can't put money in the Piggy Bank lead to more money, or less money.","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T16:22:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1912540455134167407","reply_tweet_id":"1912540455134167407","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SenBillCassidy Bad at math?<br><br>Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect<br><br>If people put money into a Piggy Bank, and those same people rarely take money out.<br><br>Would making it so those people can&#x27;t put money in the Piggy Bank lead to more money, or less money.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912542035103412526","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 16:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1912541817221882358","tweet_id":"1912541817221882358","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912541817221882358","title":"Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect If people put money into a piggy bank, and those same people rarely take m","summary":"Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect If people put money into a piggy bank, and those same people rarely take money out. Would making it so those people can't put money in the Piggy bank lead to more money, or less money? https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1912540455134167407","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T16:21:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Non-citizens with legal status pay into Social Security, and rarely collect<br><br>If people put money into a piggy bank, and those same people rarely take money out.<br><br>Would making it so those people can&#x27;t put money in the Piggy bank lead to more money, or less money? <a href=\"https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1912540455134167407\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1912540455134167407</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912541817221882358","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 16:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
