{"id":"twitter:1912534697692844172","tweet_id":"1912534697692844172","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912534697692844172","title":"Deporting and Extraditing aren't the same Deporting means returning someone to their country of origin Extraditing means deporting someone into a lega","summary":"Deporting and Extraditing aren't the same Deporting means returning someone to their country of origin Extraditing means deporting someone into a legal system or prison. Garcia was extradited, not deported Words matter","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T15:52:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Deporting and Extraditing aren&#x27;t the same<br><br>Deporting means returning someone to their country of origin<br><br>Extraditing means deporting someone into a legal system or prison.<br><br>Garcia was extradited, not deported<br><br>Words matter</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912534697692844172","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 15:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
