{"id":"twitter:1912495648147992579","tweet_id":"1912495648147992579","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912495648147992579","title":"@WordPress @ReclaimHosting @microdotblog @OpenMatt That being said, we live on a continuim and the more people who read and write out loud is better. ","summary":"@WordPress @ReclaimHosting @microdotblog @OpenMatt That being said, we live on a continuim and the more people who read and write out loud is better. If the corpus is stupid and bot filled, so are the LLMs. And it shows publishers want low overhead, low friction publication and monetization tools.","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T13:17:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912470701929332788","reply_tweet_id":"1912470701929332788","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@WordPress @ReclaimHosting @microdotblog @OpenMatt That being said, we live on a continuim and the more people who read and write out loud is better.<br><br>If the corpus is stupid and bot filled, so  are the LLMs.<br><br>And it shows publishers want low overhead, low friction publication and monetization tools.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912495648147992579","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 13:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
