{"id":"twitter:1912481886665908475","tweet_id":"1912481886665908475","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912481886665908475","title":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 I live in Connecticut, we have crazy rules. Could never run a raffle or collect money. Why all my fundraising efforts ask for pro","summary":"@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 I live in Connecticut, we have crazy rules. Could never run a raffle or collect money. Why all my fundraising efforts ask for proof of donations to others so I don't collect money. That and every time I try to turn one dollar into two, I end up owing someone three.","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T12:23:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ratty886/status/1912477444826689714","reply_tweet_id":"1912477444826689714","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ratty886 @tanyawoz1 I live in Connecticut, we have crazy rules.<br><br>Could never run a raffle or collect money.<br><br>Why all my fundraising efforts ask for proof of donations to others so I don&#x27;t collect money.<br><br>That and every time I try to turn one dollar into two, I end up owing someone three.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912481886665908475","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 12:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
