{"id":"twitter:1912459266562355361","tweet_id":"1912459266562355361","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912459266562355361","title":"A bail hearing is not a criminal proceeding. A bail hearing is not an immigration hearing. A bail hearing has much lower evidentiary thresholds Why do","summary":"A bail hearing is not a criminal proceeding. A bail hearing is not an immigration hearing. A bail hearing has much lower evidentiary thresholds Why does MAGA hate due process so much? https://x.com/willchamberlain/status/1911967562356621742","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T10:53:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A bail hearing is not a criminal proceeding.<br><br>A bail hearing is not an immigration hearing.<br><br>A bail hearing has much lower evidentiary thresholds<br><br>Why does MAGA hate due process so much? <a href=\"https://x.com/willchamberlain/status/1911967562356621742\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/willchamberlain/status/1911967562356621742</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912459266562355361","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 10:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
