{"id":"twitter:1912332007524139457","tweet_id":"1912332007524139457","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912332007524139457","title":"Hey @JackDetsch and @dlippman any insight in @DHSgov not renewing the MITRE CVE contract? @NIST got devastated in @DOGE cuts. They can't pick up the s","summary":"Hey @JackDetsch and @dlippman any insight in @DHSgov not renewing the MITRE CVE contract? @NIST got devastated in @DOGE cuts. They can't pick up the slack. This is Sooo bad for the security of American businesses. Was it a deliberate move? DHS forget to pay a bill? https://t.co/LZOVNg4i7x","date":"2025-04-16","published":"2025-04-16T02:27:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey @JackDetsch and @dlippman any insight in @DHSgov not renewing the MITRE CVE contract?<br><br>@NIST got devastated in @DOGE cuts. They can&#x27;t pick up the slack.<br><br>This is Sooo bad for the security of American businesses.<br><br>Was it a deliberate move? DHS forget to pay a bill? <a href=\"https://t.co/LZOVNg4i7x\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/LZOVNg4i7x</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a70fa53c64f1947285329cfe8e499f06.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912332007524139457","display_date":"April 16, 2025 · 02:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a70fa53c64f1947285329cfe8e499f06.jpg"]}
