{"id":"twitter:1912116608824201545","tweet_id":"1912116608824201545","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1912116608824201545","title":"Did you know the SBU Alpha Unit has the world record for longest Sniper shot at 3,800 meters. For Americans, there are around 1600 meters in a mile. W","summary":"Did you know the SBU Alpha Unit has the world record for longest Sniper shot at 3,800 meters. For Americans, there are around 1600 meters in a mile. With the @toonie_tuesday ATVs you help the Defenders move around behind enemy lines. Get those Toonies in. https://t.co/ng4xKN2gHx","date":"2025-04-15","published":"2025-04-15T12:11:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Did you know the SBU Alpha Unit has the world record for longest Sniper shot at 3,800 meters.<br><br>For Americans, there are around 1600 meters in a mile.<br><br>With the @toonie_tuesday ATVs you help the Defenders move around behind enemy lines.<br><br>Get those Toonies in. <a href=\"https://t.co/ng4xKN2gHx\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ng4xKN2gHx</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9a0347ae53de0a88052f338c122f1032.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1912116608824201545","display_date":"April 15, 2025 · 12:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9a0347ae53de0a88052f338c122f1032.jpg"]}
