{"id":"twitter:1911123468311023809","tweet_id":"1911123468311023809","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1911123468311023809","title":"How will you celebrate National Poetry Month? We are firing up the NAFO Gift-A-Poem fundraiser make a donation to a small unit . A poet will write a p","summary":"How will you celebrate National Poetry Month? We are firing up the NAFO Gift-A-Poem fundraiser make a donation to a small unit . A poet will write a poem for you to gift to someone else. We take your ideas for a poem and combine it with the word of the day https://x.com/CrazedPoet14/status/1911050914313404846 https://t.co/3amZcTCPkT","date":"2025-04-12","published":"2025-04-12T18:25:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>How will you celebrate National Poetry Month?<br><br>We are firing up the NAFO Gift-A-Poem fundraiser<br><br>make a donation to a small unit . A poet will write a poem for you to gift to  someone else.<br><br>We take your ideas for a poem and combine it with the word of the day <a href=\"https://x.com/CrazedPoet14/status/1911050914313404846\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/CrazedPoet14/status/1911050914313404846</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/3amZcTCPkT\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/3amZcTCPkT</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/80fa0369942ee7de4660082d57bdb916.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1911123468311023809","display_date":"April 12, 2025 · 18:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/80fa0369942ee7de4660082d57bdb916.png"]}
