{"id":"twitter:1911043129760764307","tweet_id":"1911043129760764307","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1911043129760764307","title":"Why did this poem lead to @safety shadow banning me @premium? I get it that it is a really bad poem, and not every into a poem where a single rhyme sc","summary":"Why did this poem lead to @safety shadow banning me @premium? I get it that it is a really bad poem, and not every into a poem where a single rhyme scheme creates fast control flow but that seems a dumb reason to shadow ban someone https://x.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1911042263272046936 https://t.co/owbOv07Git","date":"2025-04-12","published":"2025-04-12T13:06:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why did this poem lead to @safety shadow banning me @premium?<br><br>I get it that it is a really bad poem, and not every into a poem where a single rhyme scheme creates fast control flow<br><br>but that seems a dumb reason to shadow ban someone <a href=\"https://x.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1911042263272046936\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1911042263272046936</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/owbOv07Git\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/owbOv07Git</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4e1550b31537518c4004395733fd5ef2.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1911043129760764307","display_date":"April 12, 2025 · 13:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4e1550b31537518c4004395733fd5ef2.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1911042219223450000","tweet_id":"1911042219223450000","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1911042219223450000","title":"@Angeblichstan @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @JackRyanlives @MasonFlakeAlpha @ALJWS @revengehugh @MikeR498 @dale_dsll @ste","summary":"@Angeblichstan @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @JackRyanlives @MasonFlakeAlpha @ALJWS @revengehugh @MikeR498 @dale_dsll @stevesi28838948 That was awesome, I love their movies, so funny!! Also my shadow ban is back, so turn on notifications for me if you want to see my stuff","date":"2025-04-12","published":"2025-04-12T13:02:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Angeblichstan/status/1911041897809715371","reply_tweet_id":"1911041897809715371","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Angeblichstan @CaliforniaActi2 @evenstevenmb @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @JackRyanlives @MasonFlakeAlpha @ALJWS @revengehugh @MikeR498 @dale_dsll @stevesi28838948 That was awesome, I love their movies, so funny!!<br><br>Also my shadow ban is back, so turn on notifications for me if you want to see my stuff</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1911042219223450000","display_date":"April 12, 2025 · 13:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1911041751260737762","tweet_id":"1911041751260737762","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1911041751260737762","title":"Stare decisis in syndoche gauche dressings disturbing the calm A child's hand reaches out fingers timid soft, unsure only to pull back empty reasons f","summary":"Stare decisis in syndoche gauche dressings disturbing the calm A child's hand reaches out fingers timid soft, unsure only to pull back empty reasons for the decision @RealisticPoetry #7dayPoetryChallenge #smallpoem","date":"2025-04-12","published":"2025-04-12T13:00:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["7dayPoetryChallenge","smallpoem"],"body_html":"<p>Stare decisis<br> in syndoche<br>gauche<br>    dressings<br>disturbing the<br> calm<br>A child&#x27;s hand<br>reaches out<br>fingers timid<br> soft, unsure<br>only to pull<br>  back<br>empty reasons <br> for the decision<br>@RealisticPoetry <br>#7dayPoetryChallenge<br>#smallpoem</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1911041751260737762","display_date":"April 12, 2025 · 13:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
