{"id":"twitter:2051375774628774142","tweet_id":"2051375774628774142","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2051375774628774142","title":"@theliamnissan The tunnels on the Island were mainly for shipping and hurricane protection People like to talk about secret submarines to smuggle in c","summary":"@theliamnissan The tunnels on the Island were mainly for shipping and hurricane protection People like to talk about secret submarines to smuggle in children, but why smuggle things to an island you own? I have never seen Manhattan references to tunnels https://t.co/EYZUJHGAwW","date":"2026-05-04","published":"2026-05-04T18:57:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2051374902997885262","reply_tweet_id":"2051374902997885262","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@theliamnissan The tunnels on the Island were mainly for shipping and hurricane protection<br><br>People like to talk about secret submarines to smuggle in children, but why smuggle things to an island you own?<br><br>I have never seen Manhattan references to tunnels <a href=\"https://t.co/EYZUJHGAwW\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/EYZUJHGAwW</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b152e3d67ceb6cd5f7e26b97febb6abc.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2051375774628774142","display_date":"May 04, 2026 · 18:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b152e3d67ceb6cd5f7e26b97febb6abc.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:2051374902997885262","tweet_id":"2051374902997885262","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2051374902997885262","title":"@theliamnissan I will have to check it out and find the files, I am always doubtful given the long history of tunnels and the Satanic Panic of the 198","summary":"@theliamnissan I will have to check it out and find the files, I am always doubtful given the long history of tunnels and the Satanic Panic of the 1980s People conflate a loading area on the islands with tunnels due to a hatch to the sea ...but when Benny Johnson and Dom Lucre agree, I don't https://t.co/2GwMi6v2nu","date":"2026-05-04","published":"2026-05-04T18:54:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/theliamnissan/status/2051373504398827773","reply_tweet_id":"2051373504398827773","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@theliamnissan I will have to check it out and find the files, I am always doubtful given the long history of tunnels and the Satanic Panic of the 1980s<br><br>People conflate a loading area on the islands with tunnels due to a hatch to the sea<br><br>...but when Benny Johnson and Dom Lucre agree, I don&#x27;t <a href=\"https://t.co/2GwMi6v2nu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2GwMi6v2nu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6b7dacdcaf08b3601b579cf124997ba0.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2051374902997885262","display_date":"May 04, 2026 · 18:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6b7dacdcaf08b3601b579cf124997ba0.jpg"]}
