{"id":"twitter:1910094556789633533","tweet_id":"1910094556789633533","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1910094556789633533","title":"JFC here is history -Energy Policy Act of 1992, set maximum flow rate for shower heads at 2.5 gallons per minute -Obama's EPA (i think) clarified stan","summary":"JFC here is history -Energy Policy Act of 1992, set maximum flow rate for shower heads at 2.5 gallons per minute -Obama's EPA (i think) clarified standard to apply to total output of a shower head, even if it had multiple nozzles -Donald Trump complained about his hair https://x.com/atrupar/status/1910083210223943735","date":"2025-04-09","published":"2025-04-09T22:16:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>JFC here is history<br><br>-Energy Policy Act of 1992, set maximum flow rate for shower heads at 2.5 gallons per minute<br><br>-Obama&#x27;s EPA (i think) clarified standard to apply to total output of a shower head, even if it had multiple nozzles<br><br>-Donald Trump complained about his hair <a href=\"https://x.com/atrupar/status/1910083210223943735\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/atrupar/status/1910083210223943735</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1910094556789633533","display_date":"April 09, 2025 · 22:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
