{"id":"twitter:1909773645372604582","tweet_id":"1909773645372604582","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1909773645372604582","title":"@Kay_Z_18 It's good and it's bad They have habeas rights as individuals, not as a class That means individual hearings for EVERY single case, means ba","summary":"@Kay_Z_18 It's good and it's bad They have habeas rights as individuals, not as a class That means individual hearings for EVERY single case, means backlog, and you gotta get a lawyer Trump is making all the law firms bend a knee, what lawyers will do pro bono work against White House?","date":"2025-04-09","published":"2025-04-09T01:01:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Kay_Z_18/status/1909772253958468073","reply_tweet_id":"1909772253958468073","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Kay_Z_18 It&#x27;s good and it&#x27;s bad<br><br>They have habeas rights as individuals, not as a class<br><br>That means individual hearings for EVERY single case, means backlog, and you gotta get a lawyer<br><br>Trump is making all the law firms bend a knee, what lawyers will do pro bono work against White House?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1909773645372604582","display_date":"April 09, 2025 · 01:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
