{"id":"twitter:1909649228902678778","tweet_id":"1909649228902678778","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1909649228902678778","title":"The first civil rights bill was proposed in 1948. It was shot down by Dixie rats who said it was a Communist plot The Civil Rights Act did not pass un","summary":"The first civil rights bill was proposed in 1948. It was shot down by Dixie rats who said it was a Communist plot The Civil Rights Act did not pass until 1964. The Black community was not \"gaslit\" but fought for justice. Weird to be against Civil Rights https://x.com/USAFanOfTruth/status/1909647967792808060","date":"2025-04-08","published":"2025-04-08T16:47:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The first civil rights bill was proposed in 1948.<br><br>It was shot down by Dixie rats who said it was a Communist plot<br><br>The Civil Rights Act did not pass until 1964.<br><br>The Black community was not &quot;gaslit&quot; but fought for justice.<br><br>Weird to be against Civil Rights <a href=\"https://x.com/USAFanOfTruth/status/1909647967792808060\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/USAFanOfTruth/status/1909647967792808060</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1909649228902678778","display_date":"April 08, 2025 · 16:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
