{"id":"twitter:1909359280974704680","tweet_id":"1909359280974704680","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1909359280974704680","title":"@TheRealRhllor I realize it is an Administrative Stay, but Roberts stayed a unanimous order from the Appeals court. On the most flawed argument ever \"","summary":"@TheRealRhllor I realize it is an Administrative Stay, but Roberts stayed a unanimous order from the Appeals court. On the most flawed argument ever \"We know we made a mistake, but we won't free Kilmar Abrego Garcia\" Roberts could have let the 4th ruling stand","date":"2025-04-07","published":"2025-04-07T21:35:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheRealRhllor/status/1909356120570790347","reply_tweet_id":"1909356120570790347","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheRealRhllor I realize it is an Administrative Stay, but  Roberts stayed a unanimous order from the Appeals court.<br><br>On the most flawed argument ever<br><br>&quot;We know we made a mistake, but we won&#x27;t free Kilmar Abrego Garcia&quot;<br><br>Roberts could have let the 4th ruling stand</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1909359280974704680","display_date":"April 07, 2025 · 21:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
