{"id":"twitter:1908323501263421546","tweet_id":"1908323501263421546","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1908323501263421546","title":"The Carnegie Foundation funded a study by Dr Gunnar Myrdal to look into the \"negro issue\" American Dilemma was the result of the work, It was cited in","summary":"The Carnegie Foundation funded a study by Dr Gunnar Myrdal to look into the \"negro issue\" American Dilemma was the result of the work, It was cited in the Supreme Court but then used to label Gunnar Myrdal a communist mastermind behind Brown vs Board of Education https://t.co/9P8nWgmePO","date":"2025-04-05","published":"2025-04-05T00:59:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1908321326625882338","reply_tweet_id":"1908321326625882338","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The  Carnegie Foundation funded a study by Dr Gunnar Myrdal to look into the &quot;negro issue&quot;<br><br>American Dilemma was the result of the work,<br><br>It was cited in the Supreme Court but then used to label Gunnar Myrdal a communist mastermind behind Brown vs Board of Education <a href=\"https://t.co/9P8nWgmePO\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/9P8nWgmePO</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8f0a2270296c5455395815336d39e3f9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1908323501263421546","display_date":"April 05, 2025 · 00:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8f0a2270296c5455395815336d39e3f9.jpg"]}
