{"id":"twitter:1907988163269669152","tweet_id":"1907988163269669152","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1907988163269669152","title":"@travestynv @samstein With this administration, defaulting to corruption isn't a horrible stance to take. But it isn't unusual for a new LLC to be spu","summary":"@travestynv @samstein With this administration, defaulting to corruption isn't a horrible stance to take. But it isn't unusual for a new LLC to be spun up just to bid on a company. The RFP looks like it went out during Biden administration. So people will be able to get more info.","date":"2025-04-04","published":"2025-04-04T02:46:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/travestynv/status/1907986358829986172","reply_tweet_id":"1907986358829986172","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@travestynv @samstein With this administration, defaulting to corruption isn&#x27;t a horrible stance to take.<br><br>But it isn&#x27;t unusual for a new LLC to be spun up just to bid on a company.<br><br>The RFP looks like it went out during Biden administration.<br><br>So people will be able to get more info.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1907988163269669152","display_date":"April 04, 2025 · 02:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1907984875379896785","tweet_id":"1907984875379896785","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1907984875379896785","title":"@travestynv @samstein I deleted that one I was wrong. The language choices on the website were interesting English, Cyrillic, Greek, and Viatnamese Bu","summary":"@travestynv @samstein I deleted that one I was wrong. The language choices on the website were interesting English, Cyrillic, Greek, and Viatnamese But that could be template defaults for the GoDaddy tool as well for customer service debugging.","date":"2025-04-04","published":"2025-04-04T02:33:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/travestynv/status/1907983311898853711","reply_tweet_id":"1907983311898853711","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@travestynv @samstein I deleted that one I was wrong.<br><br>The language choices on the website were interesting English, Cyrillic, Greek, and Viatnamese<br><br>But that could be template defaults for the GoDaddy tool as well for customer service debugging.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1907984875379896785","display_date":"April 04, 2025 · 02:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1907983848480092451","tweet_id":"1907983848480092451","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1907983848480092451","title":"@JohnPlatner @samstein Yes the first registry I posted was wrong I wish I could go back and edit, but 44 billion dollars, rockets in space, and you ca","summary":"@JohnPlatner @samstein Yes the first registry I posted was wrong I wish I could go back and edit, but 44 billion dollars, rockets in space, and you can't add a proper edit button. This could also be nothing, or run of the mill DC Beltway banditry. Many teams responding to RFP that big spin up LLC.","date":"2025-04-04","published":"2025-04-04T02:29:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JohnPlatner/status/1907982530835353624","reply_tweet_id":"1907982530835353624","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JohnPlatner @samstein Yes the first registry I posted was wrong<br><br>I wish I could go back and edit, but 44 billion dollars, rockets in space, and you can&#x27;t add a proper edit button.<br><br>This could also be nothing, or run of the mill DC Beltway banditry.<br><br>Many teams responding to RFP that big spin up LLC.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1907983848480092451","display_date":"April 04, 2025 · 02:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1907976478207123516","tweet_id":"1907976478207123516","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1907976478207123516","title":"@DalglishTana @samstein Everyone is in Delaware, or South Dakota, and Nevada. Their State budgets are run on anonymous shell company registrations. Th","summary":"@DalglishTana @samstein Everyone is in Delaware, or South Dakota, and Nevada. Their State budgets are run on anonymous shell company registrations. The first one I posted was wrong. The one you posted is correct, but you don't have to identify benefactors of an LLC. This could be nothing at all.","date":"2025-04-04","published":"2025-04-04T02:00:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DalglishTana/status/1907975496811295231","reply_tweet_id":"1907975496811295231","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DalglishTana @samstein Everyone is in Delaware, or South Dakota, and Nevada.<br><br>Their State budgets are run on anonymous shell company registrations.<br><br>The first one I posted was wrong. The one you posted is correct, but you don&#x27;t have to identify benefactors of an LLC.<br><br>This could be nothing at all.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1907976478207123516","display_date":"April 04, 2025 · 02:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
