{"id":"twitter:1907971158999245087","tweet_id":"1907971158999245087","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1907971158999245087","title":"I have not verified any of these details, but some claims folks are making about Strategic Storage Partners, I do know the RFP was put out during the ","summary":"I have not verified any of these details, but some claims folks are making about Strategic Storage Partners, I do know the RFP was put out during the Biden Administration and it is quite normal for a bid team to spin up a new LLC or DbA for risk management and firewalls https://x.com/williamhbhamill/status/1907965153997406363 https://t.co/2tjl78ICw7","date":"2025-04-04","published":"2025-04-04T01:39:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I have not verified any of these details, but some claims folks are making about Strategic Storage Partners,<br><br>I do know the RFP was put out during the Biden Administration<br><br>and it is quite normal for a bid team to spin up a new LLC or DbA for risk management and firewalls <a href=\"https://x.com/williamhbhamill/status/1907965153997406363\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/williamhbhamill/status/1907965153997406363</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/2tjl78ICw7\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2tjl78ICw7</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f7b1d9aded6478fa8479ca1a6330c852.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1907971158999245087","display_date":"April 04, 2025 · 01:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f7b1d9aded6478fa8479ca1a6330c852.jpg"]}
