{"id":"twitter:2091518755151257906","tweet_id":"2091518755151257906","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2091518755151257906","title":"Just don’t call it a language. Don’t call these vines that grow and invade the surrounding silence a language. Don’t call these beastly shrieks of lov","summary":"Just don’t call it a language. Don’t call these vines that grow and invade the surrounding silence a language. Don’t call these beastly shrieks of love a language, or the chanting apologies to the betrayed, or the biblical laments of politicians over cities they will later burn.… https://t.co/04c2128cg1","date":"2026-08-23","published":"2026-08-23T13:31:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Just don’t call it a language.<br>Don’t call these vines that grow and invade<br>the surrounding silence a language.<br>Don’t call these beastly shrieks<br>of love a language,<br>or the chanting apologies to the betrayed,<br>or the biblical laments of politicians<br>over cities<br>they will later burn.… <a href=\"https://t.co/04c2128cg1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/04c2128cg1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bfc141978fb16a83ed11c19e8442fe2a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2091518755151257906","display_date":"August 23, 2026 · 13:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bfc141978fb16a83ed11c19e8442fe2a.jpg"]}
